@page "/projects/opengl-renderer"
@using website.Data

<div class="bg-gray-900 min-h-screen text-white p-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-400 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                3D OpenGL Renderer
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                Computer Graphics Coursework 2 - Advanced 3D rendering application implementing the complete projective graphics pipeline with modern OpenGL, featuring terrain visualization, lighting models, and interactive space launch simulation.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Project Overview -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 mb-8 border border-gray-700">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                <div class="bg-green-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-cube text-white text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Project Overview</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">COMP3811 Computer Graphics Coursework 2 - Collaborative Project</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                This advanced computer graphics coursework involved developing a comprehensive 3D rendering application using modern OpenGL.
                Built as a collaborative project, the application implements the complete projective graphics pipeline to create an
                interactive visualization of a space launch platform near the Finnish archipelago, combining real-world elevation data
                with sophisticated rendering techniques.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                The project showcases advanced 3D graphics concepts including shader-based rendering, matrix transformations,
                lighting models, texture mapping, instanced rendering, animation systems, and performance optimization through
                GPU timestamp queries.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Rendering Features -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
            <!-- 3D Graphics Pipeline -->
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-blue-600 rounded-full p-2 mr-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-project-diagram text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">3D Graphics Pipeline</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li>• <strong>Matrix Operations:</strong> 4x4 transformations and projections</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Perspective Projection:</strong> Custom matrix implementation</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Camera Systems:</strong> First-person and tracking cameras</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Coordinate Transforms:</strong> World, view, and projection spaces</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Viewport Management:</strong> Resizable window handling</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Modern OpenGL:</strong> Shader-based rendering pipeline</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Lighting & Materials -->
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-yellow-600 rounded-full p-2 mr-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-lightbulb text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Lighting & Materials</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li>• <strong>Blinn-Phong Shading:</strong> Full specular reflection model</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Point Lights:</strong> Multiple colored lights with attenuation</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Directional Lighting:</strong> Ambient and diffuse components</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Distance Attenuation:</strong> Realistic 1/r² falloff</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Material Properties:</strong> Per-object color and texture support</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Texture Mapping:</strong> Orthophoto terrain texturing</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Advanced Features -->
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-300 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                <div class="bg-purple-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-rocket text-white text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Advanced Rendering Features</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Complex 3D graphics techniques and optimizations</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-cyan-400 mb-2">Terrain Visualization</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Real Finnish elevation data from Maanmittauslaitos rendered with orthophoto
                        textures. Features 6km x 6km terrain with 2m resolution elevation mapping
                        of the Langersö archipelago region.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-400 mb-2">Instanced Rendering</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Multiple launchpad instances placed strategically in the sea environment
                        without data duplication. Efficient rendering of repeated geometry with
                        different transformations.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-2">Custom 3D Models</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Programmatically generated space vehicles using basic geometric primitives.
                        Features procedural modeling with proper normal generation for realistic
                        lighting interactions.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-orange-400 mb-2">Animation System</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Keyframe-based vehicle animation with curved flight paths, gradual
                        acceleration, and rotation alignment. Interactive controls for play,
                        pause, and reset functionality.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-red-400 mb-2">Particle Effects</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Exhaust particle system with textured point sprites, world-space
                        positioning, fixed lifetimes, and frame-rate independent simulation.
                        Additive blending for realistic visual effects.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-pink-400 mb-2">Split-Screen Rendering</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Dual viewport rendering with independent camera control for each view.
                        Efficient implementation avoiding unnecessary rendering operations and
                        supporting window resizing.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Implementation -->
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-300 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
