                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Technical Implementation</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Modern OpenGL programming and optimization techniques</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-cyan-400 mb-3">OpenGL Features</h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                        <li>✓ Modern shader-based rendering pipeline</li>
                        <li>✓ Vertex Array Objects (VAO) for efficient rendering</li>
                        <li>✓ Buffer objects for vertex and index data</li>
                        <li>✓ Texture objects with mipmap generation</li>
                        <li>✓ Uniform buffer objects for shared data</li>
                        <li>✓ GL_TIMESTAMP queries for performance measurement</li>
                        <li>✓ Framebuffer objects for split-screen rendering</li>
                        <li>✓ Alpha blending for particle transparency</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-green-400 mb-3">User Interface & Interaction</h3>
