                        <li>✓ Custom 2D UI elements with button states</li>
                        <li>✓ Real-time altitude display for space vehicle</li>
                        <li>✓ Interactive launch and reset controls</li>
                        <li>✓ Camera mode switching with keyboard input</li>
                        <li>✓ Mouse-driven first-person camera controls</li>
                        <li>✓ WASD movement with speed modifiers</li>
                        <li>✓ Fontstash integration for text rendering</li>
                        <li>✓ Event-driven input handling with GLFW</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

