                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-cyan-400 mb-3">GPU Profiling</h4>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• OpenGL timestamp queries</li>
                        <li>• Per-frame rendering time measurement</li>
                        <li>• Individual component timing analysis</li>
                        <li>• Non-blocking query result retrieval</li>
                        <li>• Statistical performance analysis</li>
