                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Rendering Efficiency</h4>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• Minimized draw calls through batching</li>
                        <li>• Efficient uniform data management</li>
                        <li>• Optimized shader compilation</li>
                        <li>• Viewport culling and clipping</li>
                        <li>• Frame-rate independent animations</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

